      "widgets_values": [
        "subject_definitions:\n<Subject 1> is Yan Qing (C01), the same young East Asian man with the same black hair, plain black short-sleeve T-shirt, dark trousers and white sneakers as in Picture 1. His face is small in this wide shot; do not turn him toward camera or duplicate him.\n<Subject 2> is the one distant street sweeper at the far right sidewalk: a small background figure in a reflective vest, back to camera, standing in place and sweeping with one long broom. He remains far from Yan Qing and never overlaps him.\n<Subject 3> is the exact same small blue-gray step-through electric bicycle from Picture 1, with the approved body, headlamp, mirrors, seat and wheels. The rear seat and rack are empty. No basket, parcel, passenger or other moving bike.\n<Picture 1> is the approved Codex-generated opening keyframe for this outbound ride. It fixes the exact street, two separated figures, vehicle, empty rear seat, screen direction, camera and dark pre-dawn lighting.\n\nsummary:\nAt 04:00 before dawn, Yan Qing rides the unloaded e-bike alone from the residential compound toward the market. In this fixed wide shot he travels frame-right. The distant sweeper stays at the far right sidewalk and sweeps in place. The rest of the road is empty.\n\nretention_analysis:\nPreserve the approved street layout, single northern lamp row, trees, iron fences, stone posts, right-side scooter shelter, parked scooters, rider and sweeper positions from Picture 1. Keep exactly one rider and one separate distant sweeper. Yan Qing remains alone on the bike, both hands on the handlebars, empty saddle behind him. He moves only frame-right; the sweeper remains in place. No person, vehicle, street furniture or light source enters, disappears, duplicates or changes side. Keep the camera fixed and the road geometry stable.\n\ndetailed_description:\nPhotorealistic natural live-action drama. Static eye-level wide establishing camera CAM0, 24mm, matching the approved keyframe; street and residential set dominate, with the rider small in frame. Very dark cool-blue 04:00 pre-dawn; streetlamps are on, the sky is nearly black, and only the eastern horizon becomes faintly pale near the end. Ordinary quiet neighborhood atmosphere, not a commercial.\n\nGEO SPATIAL LAYOUT（全镜头锁定，纯空间地图）：\n— 场地 = 中国某小区外的一条**东西向城市街道**，凌晨四点，全场无行人（远处一名环卫工人）\n— 坐标系 = x 向东为正、y 向北为正，**原点 = 街道中心线与小区大门中线的交点**（y = 0 即街心）\n— 街道 = 沥青路面，东西向，x −40…+40；**路宽 7.00m**，即 y −3.5…+3.5\n— 人行道 = 南北各一条，各宽 2.50m：北侧 y +3.5…+6.0，南侧 y −3.5…−6.0\n— 路缘石 = 南北各一道，高 0.15m，在 y = ±3.5\n— 小区大门 = 南侧，铁艺门，在 x −1.2…+1.2，y −6.0…−6.6；门内是小区院内（本场不出现在画面里）\n— 停车棚 = 南侧人行道上，轻钢棚，x −2.0…+1.0，y −4.0…−5.5，棚内停一排小电驴（**在画面近前景左下方**；骑行者从棚**外侧**经过，不穿棚）\n— 路灯 = **北侧一道**，臂式，间距 12.00m，杆位 x = −24 / −12 / 0 / +12 / +24，y = +3.6，灯头离地 6.00m\n   **南侧没有路灯。** 全场光源只有北侧这一列\n— 行道树 = 北侧人行道，间距 12.00m，与路灯交错（x = −18 / −6 / +6 / +18），树干直径 0.25m\n— 环卫工人 = 北侧人行道，x +6.0，y +4.6，**面朝北（＝背对镜头，相机朝北只能看到背面）**，**原地**挥扫帚（长杆＋扫地头）；**不沿街行进** —— 一走就两秒内出画右，与「整镜都在远处」冲突\n— 闫清（C01）：**骑小电驴**，起于小区大门内侧 x −0.6，y −5.6，**向东（+x）行进**；\n   行进路线在南侧人行道**外缘的棚外一侧**，y ≈ −3.9（**必须在车棚占地 x −2.0…+1.0, y −4.0…−5.5 之外**，否则会拍成「人穿棚而过」）；**全镜只向东走，不回头**；**双手扶把**\n— 小电驴 = 踏板式两轮电动车，车身长约 1.70m；车头小灯是唯一随人移动的光\n— **本场画面里没有手机**（用户 2026-09-21 拍板去掉前景手机）。\n— 环境亮度 = 极暗。天空无月无星，天光几乎为零\n— 名义光 = **北侧那一列路灯**（色温约 4000K，冷白，光轴垂直向下略偏向北）；\n   补光 = 无（**手机已从画面里去掉**，见下）\n— 全场阴影统一落向正下方并略偏向南（路灯在北），软阴影、无硬边投影\n— **东边天光**：本镜收尾时东侧天际线开始极弱地泛白（承接 SCN-01 的收在天亮）\n\nOne uninterrupted 8.00-second action (192 frames at 24 fps):\n0.0-1.0s Yan Qing rides steadily at low speed from frame-left toward frame-right, already on the street outside the scooter shelter, both hands on the handlebars. The rear seat stays empty.\n1.0-6.8s He continues smoothly frame-right along the road toward the market, remaining in the left-to-middle portion of the wide composition. The street sweeper stays at the far right edge of the distant sidewalk, back to camera, sweeping in place without approaching the rider.\n6.8-8.0s Yan Qing continues in the same direction toward the market; he does not stop, turn, reverse or leave the intended road. The frame ends with the same empty road, fixed set and separated figures.\n\nNo dialogue, subtitles, captions, logos, readable signs, watermark or UI. No phone, market stall, pork parcel, extra person, extra rider, passenger, second sweeper, front basket, moving traffic, wet pavement, fog, dramatic sunrise, camera movement, advertising pose, cartoon, anime or flat 3D render.",
